  "bulletin": {
    "id": "1442",
    "issue_date": "2026-10-28T12:15:00.000Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-10-28T11:54:16.678Z",
    "meteorologist": "Devid Dhakal",
    "analysis_np": "हाल देशमा पश्चिमी वायुको आंशिक प्रभाव रहेको छ। साथै भोली कार्तिक १२ गते (बिहीबार) देखि बङ्गालको खाडीमा विकसित चक्रवात “अर्नब” को पनि प्रभाव रहेने छ।",
    "analysis_en": "Westerly winds are currently having a partial influence over the country. In addition, the cyclone “Arnab,” which has developed over the Bay of Bengal, is expected to influence the country starting tomorrow, Kartik 12 (Thursday).",
    "today_np": "देशभर साधारणतया बादल लाग्नेछ। कोशी प्रदेशका हिमाली भू-भागका थोरै स्थानमा तथा बागमती, गण्डकी, लुम्बिनी, कर्णाली र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको हिमाली भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा मध्यम सम्मको वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ । मधेश प्रदेश लगायत कोशी, बागमती, गण्डकी र लुम्बिनी प्रदेशका पहाडी र तराई भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा मध्यम सम्मको वर्षाको सम्भावना छ ।",
    "today_en": "Generally cloudy throughout the country.  There is a possibility of light to moderate rain/snowfall at a few places in the Himalayan region of Koshi Province and at one or two places in the Himalayan regions of Bagmati, Gandaki, Lumbini, Karnali and Sudurpashchim provinces. There is a possibility of light to moderate rainfall at one or two places in the hilly and Terai regions of Madhesh, Koshi, Bagmati, Gandaki and Lumbini provinces.",
    "tomorrow_np": "कोशी, मधेश, बागमती, र गण्डकी प्रदेश लगायत कर्णाली र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको हिमाली भू-भागमा साधारणतया बादल लाग्नेछ । बाँकी भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ । कोशी र बागमती प्रदेशका हिमाली भू-भागका केही स्थानमा तथा बाँकी हिमली भू-भागका थोरै स्थानमा मध्यमसम्मको वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना रहको छ । मधेश प्रदेश लगायत कोशी र बागमती प्रदेशको पहाडी र तराई भू-भागका थोरै स्थानमा, गण्डकी, लुम्बिनी, कर्णाली र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको एक दुई स्थानमा मध्यमसम्मको वर्षाको सम्भावना रहेको छ।",
    "tomorrow_en": "Generally cloudy in Koshi, Madhesh, Bagmati and Gandaki provinces, as well as in the Himalayan regions of Karnali and Sudurpashchim provinces. Partly cloudy conditions are expected in the remaining areas. There is a possibility of light to moderate rain/snowfall at a few places in the Himalayan regions of Koshi and Bagmati provinces and at a few places in the remaining Himalayan regions. There is a possibility of light to moderate rainfall at a few places in the hilly and Terai regions of Madhesh, Koshi and Bagmati provinces, and at one or two places in Gandaki, Lumbini, Karnali and Sudurpashchim provinces.",
    "special": ""
  }
